{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ff94366c-280b-8d9d-999b-3efba2d406d8",
  "created_at": "2026-01-28T10:00:08-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tariq Okafor",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:56:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:56:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. I'm calling about a fence. I'm not sure if I'm calling the right office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:57:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're in the right place. What are you looking to do with the fence?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:57:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I've got an old one that's rotted out. Pretty much falling over. I want to take it down and put a new one up. Same spot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:57:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And what kind of fence are you planning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:57:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Chain-link. Four foot tall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:57:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Is the new one going exactly where the old one is, same line, same length?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:57:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same line, yes. Maybe I'd go a little longer on one end, I haven't decided. Does that matter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:57:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can. So let me ask you the first thing first. Is the old fence on your own property, along a property line, or near a street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:57:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um. It runs along the side, I think on the line with my neighbor. And the front end is toward the road. I'd have to look at the survey, I guess."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:57:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So does a fence need a permit? That's really what I'm trying to find out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:57:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally, yes, a new fence usually needs a permit here, and replacing one can too. Whether yours does depends on the height, the location, and whether it's changing from what's there now. I'd want to look at it with your address. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:58:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "212 Old Beach Road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:58:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 212 Old Beach Road. That's near Easton's Beach, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:58:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the one. Close enough to hear the water, anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:58:23-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Being that close to the shore can add some wrinkles on the review side, so it's good you called first. So you said like for like, but maybe longer on one end. If it's longer, that's an extension, and I'd treat it as a new fence for that part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:58:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. So it's the same fence but not the same fence."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:58:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sort of, yes. If you keep it exactly the same, that's a simpler conversation. If you add length, I'd say plan on applying."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:58:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. Then how long does approval take? Once I apply."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:58:55-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a basic fence application it's usually a matter of days up to a couple of weeks. It depends how busy we are and whether the plan is complete. A sketch showing where it goes and how tall, plus the property lines, helps a lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:59:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A sketch. Does it have to be drawn by somebody, or can I do it myself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:59:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can do it yourself, as long as it's clear. Measurements, distance from the lines, and the fence type and height."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:59:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I have the survey somewhere. It's on the table under, um, a pile of library books. I'll find it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:59:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good plan. I can email you the application, or you can pick one up at City Hall. Which is easier?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:59:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd rather pick it up. I don't do much with email."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:59:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. We're open today until close of business. Ask at the counter for the fence application."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:59:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So just to be sure I have it. Yes to a permit, probably. Sketch, and a week or two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:59:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, probably. If it's exactly the same footprint, bring that up at the counter too and they'll confirm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:00:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll go down this afternoon. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:00:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Okafor. Take care."
    }
  ],
